  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened capacity of member States to ratify and apply international labour standards and to fulfil their reporting obligations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This CPO will continue to support the Government of Kyrgyzstan in aligning the Labour Code with the international labour standards and comparative good practices. Capacities of the constituents and relevant stakeholders will be enhanced in drafting of ratification instruments for internal consideration and preparing for ratification of priority conventions, including Violence and Harassment Convention, 2019 (No. 190) and Private Employment Agencies Convention, 1997 (No. 181).</narrative>
  </description>
